name:"Bring Me Back"

author:"Zekk"

[00:12.35] Do you remember when
[00:15.52] We stayed up every night?
[00:17.51] We used to make our plans
[00:20.42] 'Til early morning light
[00:22.89] And I just don't know
[00:25.37] Why we didn't even try
[00:27.65] I hope you understand
[00:31.14] I won't ever forget
[00:32.92] And now I-
[00:38.45] When we were young and we were dumb
[00:40.80] We were always on the run
[00:43.58] How I miss those brighter days
[00:46.26] Just bring me back, just bring me back
[00:49.28] No problem in the world
[00:51.34] Just your lips saying sweet words
[00:54.28] How I miss those brighter days
[00:56.92] Just bring me back, just bring me back, yeah
